      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH Appliances also offers robust OEM services to help you build your brand. Our extensive range of personal care and home appliance products—combined with our market-certified production facilities and the professional expertise and experience of our team—will help you stand out in your target market.",
